# No Inference

## 🚫 NEVER

- Infer function from naming (must Read code)
- Infer behavior from type (must check implementation)
- Infer structure from pattern (must actually verify)

## ✅ MUST

- View actual code
- Verify actual behavior
- Confirm actual structure

**Core Principle: Inference is a form of speculation.**
